§ `s 386AIA: ensuring the register is up to date and correct`

#ASSERT `s 386AIA(6) a relevant change occurs` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 386AIA(6) a relevant change occurs` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 386AIA(6) a relevant change occurs` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (1) purposes: arguments: requires confirmation of a relevant change (and its date and particulars); requires confirmation that the stated particulars are correct (and the correct ones)
