#ASSERT `s 386AIA(1) the notice serves the purposes the subsection lists` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 386AIA(1) the notice serves the purposes the subsection lists` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (1) frequency: arguments: given the next notice; the day it was given; the day the previous notice was given; the prescribed frequency in days; the date asked
-- a 90-day frequency from 1 January 2026 (a non-leap year): 90 days after is 1 April 2026
#ASSERT `s 386AIA(1) the company or foreign company has given the next notice at the prescribed frequency` TRUE (Date 1 4 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) 90 (Date 10 4 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 386AIA(1) the company or foreign company has given the next notice at the prescribed frequency` TRUE (Date 2 4 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) 90 (Date 10 4 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
