§ `s 386AJ: the controller's duty to provide information`

-- arguments: the person knows or ought reasonably to know the person is a registrable controller; the person has received a notice under 386AG(2) and complied with it in time
#ASSERT `s 386AJ(1) the person must notify the company or foreign company` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 386AJ(1) the person must notify the company or foreign company` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 386AJ(1) the person must notify the company or foreign company` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 386AJ(1) the person must notify the company or foreign company` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- arguments: notified; stated the date; provided the other information; the day completed; the day first knew or ought to have known; the prescribed period in days; the date asked
#ASSERT `s 386AJ(1) and (2) the person has complied with the requirements in time` TRUE TRUE TRUE (Date 15 6 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) 14 (Date 20 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 386AJ(1) and (2) the person has complied with the requirements in time` TRUE TRUE TRUE (Date 16 6 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) 14 (Date 20 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the third thing missing, and the last day passed
#ASSERT `s 386AJ(1) and (2) the person has complied with the requirements in time` TRUE TRUE FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 1 6 2026) 14 (Date 16 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the second thing missing, and the last day not yet passed
#ASSERT `s 386AJ(1) and (2) the person has complied with the requirements in time` TRUE FALSE TRUE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 1 6 2026) 14 (Date 15 6 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 386AJ(1) and (2) the person has complied with the requirements in time` FALSE FALSE FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 1 6 2026) 14 (Date 15 6 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
